Z||000000||maryjane||10-07-2001||01:03 AM||||Any opinions on the FBI's use of a large net device they are attaching to the ISP's 'core' to canvass emails and boards for information? It's called Carnivore, tho the name has been recently changed to appear less intrusive. This link will tell a little about it. Not very objectivly, but it's a place to start if you want more info. <A HREF="http://www.stopcarnivore.org/what_is_carnivore.htm" TARGET=_blank>http://www.stopcarnivore.org/what_is_carnivore.htm</A> <p>[This message has been edited by maryjane (edited 10-07-2001).]||||reg||1
